    affiliation: "Tianyu Vision (TIANYU VISION); MA, History of Science, Tsinghua University"
    website: "https://tianyu.art/"
abstract: >
  An end-to-end Claude Code / Claude Agent SDK skill for humanities
  scholars (history, philosophy, literature, cultural studies, art history,
  religious studies, classics, intellectual history, science studies) whose
  primary deliverable is a long-form argumentative text. Covers the full
  writing lifecycle: research-question sharpening (Mode H Socratic),
  literature mapping (Mode I), plan-only outlining (Mode J), conception
  and drafting (Mode C), paragraph dialogue (Mode A), chapter review
  (Mode B four-layer critique), devil's advocate with 1-5 calibration and
  methodology-focus sub-mode (Mode D), writing-bottleneck assistance
  (Mode E), draft revision with revision-coach sub-mode (Mode F), blind
  reading (Mode G), and AI-use disclosure for humanities journals
  (Mode K). Deep-voice preservation ("my hand writes my voice"), discipline-
  specific critique routing (seven main humanities disciplines + cross-
  disciplinary case), ADHD-friendly interaction design, and engineering-
  grade infrastructure (version control, systematic validation, AI-trace
  scanning, citation toolchain with format conversion and Crossref
  verification). Bilingual: SKILL.md and README in English and Chinese.
keywords:
  - claude-skill
